# Lexly

Next.js app for turning YouTube subtitles into vocabulary practice.
Scope: `LEX`.

## Tech / UX expectations

- Next.js App Router.
- shadcn/ui components + Tailwind class-based styling for UI.
- No auth for MVP (single implicit learner).
- Drizzle ORM with PostgreSQL.

## Implementation boundaries

- Domain logic (transcript parsing, dictionary lookup, SRS scheduling) lives under:
  - `src/server/`
  - `src/db/`
  - `src/services/` (client fetch + server services)
- Route handlers live under `src/app/api/**/route.ts`.

## Styling

- Prefer shadcn/ui + Tailwind classNames for component styling.
- Keep layout containers responsive (mobile-first, then enhance).

